      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In any instance where the above time schedule cannot be met and the bill to be reported on appears to be harmful to the interests of the City, Mr. Ruggieri should be notified immediately and advised as to the probable date on which he will receive the report. The telephone numbers of the City's office in Albany are HEmlock 4-4605, HEmlock 4-2614 and HObart 3-2005.",
