      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Sometimes a State executive agency or legislative committee writes directly to a City Agency requesting the views of the City Agency on pending or contemplated legislation. On occasion, State officials request City officials to make a personal appearance before a joint legislative committee or a temporary State commission.",
